sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Agent
    participant Snapshot as PolicySnapshot JSON
    participant Resolver as Netlink Resolver
    participant Maps as Inactive A/B Maps
    participant Devmap as tx_devmap
    participant Runtime as runtime_config
    participant Control as Control API

    Agent->>Runtime: Read active_slot + current version
    Agent->>Snapshot: Verify schema/checksum/object/capacity
    Agent->>Resolver: Resolve unresolved service forwarding metadata
    Resolver-->>Agent: output_ifindex, source MAC, next-hop MAC
    Agent->>Snapshot: Re-sign resolved snapshot
    Agent->>Maps: Clear inactive slot
    Agent->>Maps: Populate CIDR, UDP, service, rule maps
    Agent->>Devmap: Upsert devmap_key -> ifindex
    Agent->>Runtime: Flip active_slot and policy_version
    Agent->>Agent: Persist last-valid snapshot
    Agent->>Control: Ack apply status and stats
    Note over Agent,Runtime: Any failure before flip keeps old active slot
